        "original_id": "9a0b6fa7-c8bb-5d6b-b8de-9a961e250ca2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Beach, David Ayer, Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman, Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Ike Barinholtz, Scott Eastwood, Cara Delevingne\n- Works: Arctic Air, Suicide Squad, Cold, Law & Order: Special Victims Unit\n- Roles: Slipknot, Detective Chester Lake\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Beach starred in the Canadian series Arctic Air from 2012 to 2014.\n- Suicide Squad is a 2016 film, and Adam Beach played Slipknot in it.\n- Suicide Squad was written and directed by David Ayer.\n- Suicide Squad stars an ensemble cast featuring Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman, Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Ike Barinholtz, Scott Eastwood, and Cara Delevingne.\n- In the Law & Order: Special Victims Unit episode Cold, Detective Chester Lake, played by Adam Beach, refuses to cooperate after fatally shooting a police officer.\n- In the Law & Order: Special Victims Unit episode Cold, the Special Victims Unit squad investigates what Detective Chester Lake is hiding.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
